{"data":"<div class=\"rounded bg-white h-100\">\r\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\r\n        <div class=\"p-3\">\r\n            <div id=\"player\" class=\"d-none\"><\/div>\r\n            <h1 class=\"m-0 font-weight-600\">[U4-P4]\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8<\/h1>\r\n                    <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"activity-quiz-history-body ml-3\">\r\n                            <div class=\"activity-quiz-history-description custom-bg-gray rounded p-1 ck-content\">\r\n                    <p><strong>1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Gi\u00fap sinh vi\u00ean n\u00e2ng cao k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng vi\u1ebft ch\u1eef H\u00e1n c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 l\u00e0m quen v\u00e0 nh\u1edb m\u1eb7t ch\u1eef khi \u0111\u1ecdc c\u00e1c t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u ti\u1ebfng Nh\u1eadt.<\/li><li>Ngo\u00e0i ra, sinh vi\u00ean c\u00f2n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 h\u1ecdc th\u00eam c\u00e1c c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc, \u00fd ngh\u0129a H\u00e1n v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb v\u1ef1ng li\u00ean quan c\u1ee7a ch\u1eef H\u00e1n \u0111\u00f3.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>2. Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Sinh vi\u00ean vi\u1ebft m\u1ed7i ch\u1eef H\u00e1n 10 l\u1ea7n.&nbsp;<\/li><li>B\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi vi\u1ebft th\u00eam ngh\u0129a, c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 t\u1eeb v\u00ed d\u1ee5 c\u1ee7a ch\u1eef H\u00e1n \u0111\u00f3 2 l\u1ea7n.<\/li><li>Ch\u1ee5p l\u1ea1i to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u00e3 vi\u1ebft v\u00e0 n\u1ed9p l\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.<\/li><\/ul><p><strong>3. L\u01b0u \u00fd<\/strong>: \u0110\u1ecdc k\u1ef9 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u l\u00e0m b\u00e0i tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi l\u00e0m v\u00e0 n\u1ed9p.<\/p><p><strong>4. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh: <\/strong>N\u1ed9p b\u00e0i \u0111\u00fang y\u00eau c\u1ea7u<\/p>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n                        <div class=\"d-flex-not-important align-items-center my-3\">\r\n                    <a class=\"rounded btn btn-outline-primary max-content mr-2\" class=\"\"  href=\"https:\/\/digital.nix.edu.vn\/learnin